      "start_seconds": 0.57,
      "end_seconds": 2.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "Morning, come on through."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 3.08,
      "end_seconds": 7.45,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "Yeah, um, afternoon, is this seat fine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.36,
      "end_seconds": 11.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Right, what's the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.04,
      "end_seconds": 15.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "it's muscle weakness, mostly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.67,
      "end_seconds": 20.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "okay, did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.46,
      "end_seconds": 24.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "About... well, ten days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.63,
      "end_seconds": 33.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Rate it for me, mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.25,
      "end_seconds": 47.31,
      "duration_seconds": 13.06,
      "text": "erm, a a six out of ten, I suppose i've had aching muscles in my thighs too, uh, for about a week"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.24,
      "end_seconds": 52.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "would you say mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.16,
      "end_seconds": 63.33,
      "duration_seconds": 10.17,
      "text": "Maybe a five out of ten on a bad day. Mm, and dark urine once as well, since Friday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.08,
      "end_seconds": 77.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "I'll note down your vital signs first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.1,
      "end_seconds": 93.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.29,
      "end_seconds": 118.56,
      "duration_seconds": 14.27,
      "text": "Okay: weight 91 kilos, saturation 98 percent, temp 36.8 degrees, BMI works out to 38.9, height 153 centimetres, heart rate 72, blood pressure 122 over 68."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.95,
      "end_seconds": 123.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.69,
      "end_seconds": 128.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "I'll interpret them after the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.29,
      "end_seconds": 133.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Okay, time for me to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.77,
      "end_seconds": 136.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.9,
      "end_seconds": 158.32,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "The thigh muscles are tender and the strength is slightly reduced."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.95,
      "end_seconds": 168.59,
      "duration_seconds": 5.64,
      "text": "Please sit back down. Have you had any rash, fever or joint swelling?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.29,
      "end_seconds": 174.99,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7,
      "text": "No rash, fever or joint swelling, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.41,
      "end_seconds": 179.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Alright, and chest pain, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.64,
      "end_seconds": 182.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "Definitely no chest pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.55,
      "end_seconds": 188.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "okay, how about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.18,
      "end_seconds": 191.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.81,
      "end_seconds": 197.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "any change in your bowel habit or your stomach generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.83,
      "end_seconds": 202.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "Well, bowels are regular, nothing odd."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.08,
      "end_seconds": 206.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.4,
      "end_seconds": 212.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "Uh, um, my brother has epilepsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.86,
      "end_seconds": 219.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.62,
      "end_seconds": 226.37,
      "duration_seconds": 4.75,
      "text": "uh, uh, yes, kiwi i get hives"
